We take security very seriously. If you believe you have found a
security issue in this HarmonyOS port, report it privately through
GitHub's "Report a vulnerability" button on this repository's Security
tab. Please do not open a public issue for it, and do not report it to
the Wikimedia Foundation: the upstream project does not ship this code.

If the issue is in Wikipedia itself (the websites, the MediaWiki APIs or
other Wikimedia servers the app talks to), see
<https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Reporting_security_bugs>
for information on how to responsibly report it.
